      "mentions": [
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei recalls that Limitless Demon Venerable’s left path passes Central Heaven Gate, Name Plaque Palace, Sun Palace, Five Deity Hall, Central Great Hall, Heaven Overseeing Tower, Forgotten Dao Lake, and finally Imperfection Regret Pavilion on the peak of Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "house_central_heaven_gate",
        "loc_name_plaque_palace",
        "loc_sun_palace",
        "loc_five_deity_hall",
        "loc_central_great_hall",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "loc_imperfection_regret_pavilion",
        "loc_star_zone_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same route is restated when Longevity Heaven enters the left path: Forgotten Dao Lake stands after Heaven Overseeing Tower and before the pavilion on Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "left-path-node",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In an Olden Antiquity Era recollection, after Limitless Demon Venerable’s slaughter, the water of Forgotten Dao Lake turns blood red. Star Constellation’s will names the lake; Limitless Demon Venerable finds the name fitting and declines to destroy it, asking who can really forget their Dao. Forgotten Dao Lake and Imperfection Regret Pavilion are part of Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s meticulous set up with the nine-nine consecutive unceasing formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
